  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:54:10.538559Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:54:10.538559Z",
  "totalBlocks": 65,
  "translatedBlocks": 65,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "简介",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "298d96f01e62115c",
      "translationZh": "ControlNet 是一种神经网络结构，通过添加额外条件实现对扩散模型的细粒度控制。该技术随论文《Adding Conditional Control to Text-to-Image Diffusion Models》首次亮相，并随着作者发布 8 种控制 Stable Diffusion v1-5 的条件（姿态估计、深度图、Canny 边缘、草图等）迅速席卷开源扩散社区。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dd683227cb6f69f",
      "translationZh": "本博文将详细讲讲我们训练 Uncanny Faces 模型的每一步——一个基于 3D 合成人脸的面部姿态模型（uncanny faces 其实是个意外，看看它是怎么来的）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7f2862f91cd48a9",
      "translationZh": "开始为 Stable Diffusion 训练你的 ControlNet",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29780fceaafb5400",
      "translationZh": "训练自己的 ControlNet 需要 3 步：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9861e6baeed3715",
      "translationZh": "规划你的条件：ControlNet 足够灵活，能把 Stable Diffusion 驯服到许多任务上。预训练模型展示了广泛的条件类型，社区还构建了其他条件，比如基于像素化调色板的条件。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe8fd2a5f1d9dd13",
      "translationZh": "构建数据集：条件定下来后，就该构建数据集了。你可以从零构建，也可以用现有数据集的子集。训练模型的数据集需要三列：真值图像（ground truth image）、conditioning_image 和 prompt。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1cd59f97d8bbc2a",
      "translationZh": "训练模型：数据集就绪后就可以训练模型了。多亏 diffusers 的训练脚本，这是最简单的部分。你需要一块至少 8GB 显存的 GPU。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2c32d5cd31df0438",
      "translationZh": "1. 规划你的条件",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfebe8ea08081b87",
      "translationZh": "规划条件时，思考两个问题很有用：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e96e6f5987a63d2f",
      "translationZh": "我想用哪种条件？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "523a9452ca52850e",
      "translationZh": "是否已有能把“普通”图像转成我的条件的现成模型？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "024005b6d6e82c6d",
      "translationZh": "在我们的例子里，我们考虑用面部关键点条件。我们的理由是：1. 通用关键点条件的 ControlNet 效果不错。2. 面部关键点是非常普及的技术，有多个模型能在普通图片上计算面部关键点。3. 驯服 Stable Diffusion 去遵循某个面部关键点、或模仿你自己的面部表情，应该会很有趣。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ede763c1f18ed729",
      "translationZh": "2. 构建数据集",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09407793b83a46c6",
      "translationZh": "好！我们决定做面部关键点的 Stable Diffusion 条件。那么准备数据集需要：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77d5b7f18afd18fe",
      "translationZh": "真值图像：本例是人脸图像",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "205a2c59bd34478a",
      "translationZh": "conditioning_image：本例是可视化了面部关键点的图像",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "029b47526e35abfd",
      "translationZh": "caption：描述所用图像的说明文字",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f4fa20372e02ec7",
      "translationZh": "这个项目我们选了 Microsoft 的 FaceSynthetics 数据集：它包含 10 万张合成人脸。也有 Celeb-A HQ、FFHQ 等真实人脸的研究数据集——但本项目我们决定用合成人脸。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16fb3488f2658393",
      "translationZh": "FaceSynthetics 数据集听起来是很好的起点：它包含人脸真值图像、以 iBUG 68 面部关键点格式标注的面部关键点，以及人脸分割图像。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75476a591aec810",
      "translationZh": "完美。对吧？遗憾的是，并不完美。还记得“规划你的条件”一步中的第二个问题吗——应该有模型能把普通图像转成你的条件？结果发现，没有任何已知模型能把人脸转成该数据集的标注关键点格式。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1875ac312879993",
      "translationZh": "于是我们决定走另一条路：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bb6149e0bdbd04e",
      "translationZh": "使用 FaceSynthetics 数据集的人脸真值图像",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f854219fa4f7f15d",
      "translationZh": "用一个能把任何人脸图像转成 iBUG 68 面部关键点格式的已知模型（我们用了最先进的 SPIGA）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "041c3c927d2afdc6",
      "translationZh": "用自定义代码把面部关键点转成精美的图示蒙版，作为 conditioning_image",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "934b433b71bf9277",
      "translationZh": "把它保存为 Hugging Face 数据集",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de3be70d900ac7ae",
      "translationZh": "把 FaceSynthetics 数据集的真值图像转换成图示蒙版并存为 Hugging Face 数据集的代码在这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5aed6d6bc87403c8",
      "translationZh": "现在数据集有了真值图像和 conditioning_image，还差一步：每张图像的说明文字。这一步强烈建议做，不过你也可以试试空提示，回头报告结果。由于 FaceSynthetics 数据集没有说明文字，我们用 BLIP 跑了图像描述。生成所有图像描述的代码见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39450a9f5e19155a",
      "translationZh": "至此我们得到了最终数据集！Face Synthetics SPIGA with captions 为 FaceSynthetics 的 10 万张图像提供了真值图像、分割图和说明文字。可以训练模型了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68fb2231e5e3804d",
      "translationZh": "3. 训练模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2840428b09d2353",
      "translationZh": "数据集就绪，该训练模型了！虽然这本来应该是整个流程最难的部分，但有了 diffusers 的训练脚本，结果却是最简单的。我们用了在 LambdaLabs 租的一块每小时 1.10 美元的 A100。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f50ea7fb096d87c4",
      "translationZh": "我们的训练经验",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb65a6f4d5dfe7f2",
      "translationZh": "我们训练了 3 个 epoch（即 10 万张图像的批次给模型看了 3 遍），批大小为 4（每步给模型看 4 张图像）。结果证明这过度了，并且过拟合（模型忘了与真人有些偏差的概念：比如提示“shrek”或“a cat”不会生成史莱克或猫，而是一个人；而且开始忽略风格）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ad7e795509edc65",
      "translationZh": "只用 1 个 epoch（即模型“看过”一遍 10 万张图像后），它就已经收敛到遵循姿态且不过拟合。所以它有效，但……由于我们用的是合成人脸数据集而非真实数据集，模型学到的是怪异的 3D 质感人脸而非写实人脸。鉴于训练用的是合成人脸数据，这合情合理，而且可以用于搞笑/梗图用途。这就是 uncannyfaces_25K 模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01e94f109e8a4479",
      "translationZh": "在这个交互表格里，你可以拖动滑块查看模型经历的训练步数及其对训练过程的影响。大约 15K 步时它已经开始学习姿态，约 25K 步时成熟。见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4e08be50f1a2495b",
      "translationZh": "我们是怎么训练的",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "317f411784fe18d9",
      "translationZh": "我们要做的只是安装依赖：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "966d2a47649a1bb4",
      "translationZh": "然后运行 train_controlnet.py 代码。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "609e91ab11797532",
      "translationZh": "我们来拆解一些设置，也讲讲把训练显存压到 8GB 的一些优化技巧。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42c37a7c96177599",
      "translationZh": "pretrained_model_name_or_path：你想用的 Stable Diffusion 基础模型（我们选了 v2-1，因为它对人脸渲染更好）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1697816ca4393c03",
      "translationZh": "output_dir：你希望保存模型的目录",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a28215e07e8a7185",
      "translationZh": "dataset_name：用于训练的数据集。本例是 Face Synthetics SPIGA with captions",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e05895dad12cd310",
      "translationZh": "conditioning_image_column：数据集中包含条件图像的列名（本例是 spiga_seg）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6e3516bb7ef2a4a",
      "translationZh": "image_column：数据集中包含真值图像的列名（本例是 image）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47d7071526cfd5c9",
      "translationZh": "caption_column：数据集中包含图像说明的列名（本例是 image_caption）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6a8d0716a6c1cba",
      "translationZh": "resolution：条件图像与真值图像的分辨率（本例是 512x512）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c21dc40239dc2a58",
      "translationZh": "learning_rate：学习率。我们发现 1e-5 对这些例子效果很好，但你可以尝试不同值，比如在 1e-4 到 2e-6 之间。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c64c035a25ece83a",
      "translationZh": "validation_image：这是让你在训练中偷看进展的！验证图像每过 validation_steps 步运行一次，你可以看到训练的走向。在这里填入任意数量条件图像的本地路径。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c13461602cadb187",
      "translationZh": "validation_prompt：与验证图像一起运行的提示。可以是任何能检验模型是否训练良好的内容。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04267cdd29a7b520",
      "translationZh": "train_batch_size：要装进 GPU 的训练批大小。因为有 A100 我们能开到 4；如果你的 GPU 显存较低，建议把这个值降到 1。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d18ccd5a7e5efbf",
      "translationZh": "num_train_epochs：每个 epoch 对应训练集图像被模型“看”几遍。我们试了 3 个 epoch，但结果最好的只需要略多于 1 个 epoch——3 个 epoch 时模型过拟合了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "846cfecc997165c7",
      "translationZh": "checkpointing_steps：每 x 步保存一个中间检查点（本例是 5000）。每 5000 步保存一次中间检查点。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09227cc5b0883931",
      "translationZh": "validation_steps：每 x 步运行一次 validation_prompt 与 validation_image。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93bb302c9a5e814a",
      "translationZh": "report_to：把训练上报到哪里。这里我们用了 Weights and Biases，它给了我们这份漂亮的报告。但把 train_batch_size 从 4 降到 1 可能还不足以让训练装进小 GPU，下面按 GPU 显存大小给出需要额外添加的参数：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60e3f0ffaf84c097",
      "translationZh": "push_to_hub：把最终训练好的模型推送到 Hugging Face Hub 的参数。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e97b23f585215f63",
      "translationZh": "装进 16GB 显存的 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7eb0a2df85db5d43",
      "translationZh": "批大小 1 加 4 步梯度累积，等价于我们示例中原始的批大小 4。此外，我们启用了梯度检查点和 8 位 Adam 以进一步省内存。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "35c6b06e92a77556",
      "translationZh": "装进 12GB 显存的 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa3a349ff0a3e45f",
      "translationZh": "装进 8GB 显存的 GPU",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e46a66ff5ae306d4",
      "translationZh": "请按照我们的这份指南操作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "35c75060b185b540",
      "translationZh": "4. 结论！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04d56578eaa213ac",
      "translationZh": "这次训练 ControlNet 的体验非常有趣。我们成功训练了一个能跟随真人面部姿态的模型——不过它学到的是生成怪异的 3D 质感人脸而非写实的 3D 人脸，因为它的训练数据就是这种数据，这也自有一番魅力与风味。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ace9738df3185a24",
      "translationZh": "来试试我们的 Hugging Face Space：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d44ca8d31a9ea7d",
      "translationZh": "至于我们的下一步：为了生成看起来写实的人脸、同时仍然不用真实人脸数据集，一个想法是把整个 FaceSynthetics 数据集跑一遍 Stable Diffusion Image2Image，把 3D 质感的人脸转成写实的人脸，然后再训练另一个 ControlNet。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c14131a37f4aeeed",
      "translationZh": "敬请期待，我们即将举办 ControlNet 训练活动！关注 Hugging Face 的 Twitter 或加入我们的 Discord 获取最新消息。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
